    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cardventure: JustAHead!\u00a0</strong>is a unique action-roguelike where you play as the decapitated yet still-conscious <strong>head of the Demon Lord</strong>, awakening on a broken throne to begin your journey of <strong>revenge and rebuilding</strong>.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat uses the innovative <strong>\u201cEnemies Only Move When You Do\u201d</strong> system\u2014say goodbye to twitchy reflexes! No reaction speed required. Whether you\u2019re a seasoned strategist or just terrible at action games, you can still enjoy the thrill of dodging and smashing!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/b389af4237733d733274f2115e8d169e.poster.avif?t=1749632769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/b389af4237733d733274f2115e8d169e.webm?t=1749632769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/b389af4237733d733274f2115e8d169e.mp4?t=1749632769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Turn-Based Action Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies only respond after your move. Easy to control, yet offering the tension and satisfaction of a Soulslike\u2014minus the pain. Timing, positioning, and clever planning are all that matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf A World Made of Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters, environments, skills\u2014everything is a <strong>card</strong>. Interact with the entire world as cards. Break conventions, build creative strategies, and fight in a whole new way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Deep Build Variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch explosive eyeball lasers. Dash through enemies with lightning lances. Punch enemies to dust with the Demon Fist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match hundreds of ability cards\u2014lightning, bombs, bats, and more! Discover unexpected builds through random encounters and forge <strong>your own playstyle</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc09 Memorable Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drown in a slime horde. Get outdrawn by a Lucky Hunter. Every boss has its <strong>own mechanics</strong>\u2014observe, adapt, and strike back with style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcac Rich Dialogue &amp; Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has unique dialogue and backstory. Through countless attempts, you'll gradually uncover the <strong>true secret</strong> behind the Demon Lord\u2019s resurrection...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/0693aa2520229a315994801c0c89e4e4.poster.avif?t=1749632769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/0693aa2520229a315994801c0c89e4e4.webm?t=1749632769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/0693aa2520229a315994801c0c89e4e4.mp4?t=1749632769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c World Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 159 of the Holy Calendar.<br>The Demon Lord was slain by the Hero.<br>The castle lies in ruins. His minions have fled. Monsters lurk, scheming for the empty throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no one knows...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2014the severed head of the Demon Lord\u2014still draw breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;This is not revenge.</strong><br><strong>I'm simply taking back what's mine.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705 Who Should Play This?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who love Hades, The Binding of Isaac, or Hollow Knight, but want less mechanical pressure and more tactical depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of build crafting, smart positioning, and engaging boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loyal followers of the Demon Lord \ud83d\ude08</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cardventure: JustAHead!\u00a0</strong>is a unique action-roguelike where you play as the decapitated yet still-conscious <strong>head of the Demon Lord</strong>, awakening on a broken throne to begin your journey of <strong>revenge and rebuilding</strong>.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat uses the innovative <strong>\u201cEnemies Only Move When You Do\u201d</strong> system\u2014say goodbye to twitchy reflexes! No reaction speed required. Whether you\u2019re a seasoned strategist or just terrible at action games, you can still enjoy the thrill of dodging and smashing!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/b389af4237733d733274f2115e8d169e.poster.avif?t=1749632769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/b389af4237733d733274f2115e8d169e.webm?t=1749632769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/b389af4237733d733274f2115e8d169e.mp4?t=1749632769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Turn-Based Action Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies only respond after your move. Easy to control, yet offering the tension and satisfaction of a Soulslike\u2014minus the pain. Timing, positioning, and clever planning are all that matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udccf A World Made of Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters, environments, skills\u2014everything is a <strong>card</strong>. Interact with the entire world as cards. Break conventions, build creative strategies, and fight in a whole new way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Deep Build Variety</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch explosive eyeball lasers. Dash through enemies with lightning lances. Punch enemies to dust with the Demon Fist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match hundreds of ability cards\u2014lightning, bombs, bats, and more! Discover unexpected builds through random encounters and forge <strong>your own playstyle</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc09 Memorable Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drown in a slime horde. Get outdrawn by a Lucky Hunter. Every boss has its <strong>own mechanics</strong>\u2014observe, adapt, and strike back with style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcac Rich Dialogue &amp; Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has unique dialogue and backstory. Through countless attempts, you'll gradually uncover the <strong>true secret</strong> behind the Demon Lord\u2019s resurrection...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/0693aa2520229a315994801c0c89e4e4.poster.avif?t=1749632769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/0693aa2520229a315994801c0c89e4e4.webm?t=1749632769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720420/extras/0693aa2520229a315994801c0c89e4e4.mp4?t=1749632769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c World Setting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 159 of the Holy Calendar.<br>The Demon Lord was slain by the Hero.<br>The castle lies in ruins. His minions have fled. Monsters lurk, scheming for the empty throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no one knows...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2014the severed head of the Demon Lord\u2014still draw breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;This is not revenge.</strong><br><strong>I'm simply taking back what's mine.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2705 Who Should Play This?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who love Hades, The Binding of Isaac, or Hollow Knight, but want less mechanical pressure and more tactical depth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of build crafting, smart positioning, and engaging boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loyal followers of the Demon Lord \ud83d\ude08</p></li></ul>",
